            0.883,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The materials that are required to make a tumbler should be capable of holding water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.749,
            0.883,
            0.831
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What decides which material should be used for making an object? We choose a material to make an object depending on its properties and the purpose for which the object is to be used."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.831,
            0.885,
            0.894
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We may use different materials for making different parts of an object. For example, a pen may be made up of different materials like plastic, metal and ink."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
